OL,3,GNEWSADundee councillors approve #21m
OL,4,ARAAC repair scheme
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillors have approved a #21m repair
OL,7,Fscheme for RAAC-affected homes in
OL,8,FDundee.
OL,10,FWork will be carried out on
OL,11,Fcouncil-owned properties and in
OL,12,Fbuildings where the local authority
OL,13,Fretains an interest.
OL,15,FThe council has agreed to write to both
OL,16,Fthe UK and Scottish governments seeking
OL,17,Ffinancial support and a dedicated
OL,18,Ffunding mechanism for homeowners.
OL,20,FAlmost 1,000 homes in the city contain
OL,21,Fthe defective concrete - the highest
OL,22,Fnumber in Scotland.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
